I'm still able to reproduce it with -rc4 and the attached config file.
Kernel was built with:
- gcc (Ubuntu 4.9.1-16ubuntu6) 4.9.1
- GNU ld (GNU Binutils for Ubuntu) 2.24.90.20141014

I'm using Ubuntu 14.10

	Oded

